Description: GTK4 typing tutor for Wubi 98 and 86
 WubiType is a GTK4 typing tutor for the Wubi 98 and Wubi 86
 Chinese input methods. It provides character, phrase, key-specific
 and passage practice, an on-screen keyboard, code lookup, mistake
 review and speed/accuracy statistics.
